Revision: b7d179d950710981383814183601024537d9a440
License: Apache-2.0 (see the workspace LICENSE).

Selected adapter sources: src/main.rs, src/commands.rs, src/extraction.rs,
src/connect.rs, src/mcp.rs, src/switch.rs, src/switch_config.rs,
src/switch_files.rs, and graph hook portions of src/agent_setup.rs.
Selected tests derive from the tests in those files and tests/cli.rs;
the authored legacy SQLite fixture is tests/fixtures/native-format1.sql.

Modifications: Rust library entry points, ctx graph command namespace,
concern-based module separation, ctx-owned explicit hook receipts,
and shared ctx skill/MCP installation ownership. Existing Graf graph
models, storage and engine implementations are used through the pinned
public dependency rather than copied into this crate.

Graf's embedded viewer/report/Python assets and its dependencies retain
their upstream licenses and applicable notices in their original sources.
